==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm|en}} {{m|enm|bismerwen}}, from {{etyl|ang|en}} {{m|ang|besmirwan}}, {{m|ang|besmierwan||to besmear}}, equivalent to {{prefix|en|be|smear}}. Cognate with {{cog|nl|besmeren||to besmear}}, {{cog|de|beschmieren||to besmear}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɪə(ɹ)|lang=en}}

